{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Last Sanctum",
    "steam_appid": 3646380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646380/extras/4d723f7ffa751e3236f849349695ead9.avif?t=1752255894\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Sanctum is a dark fantasy tactical RPG where memory, spirits, and nightmare intertwine in a dying world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You are The Collector\u2014a spirit tuner known only through whispers and fear. Neither alive nor dead, you awaken in the shattered ruins of your sanctum, a vessel of forgotten power, with no memory of who you were or what broke the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 To uncover the truth, you must bind wandering spirits, harvest fragments of lost memories, and confront creatures born of fear and sorrow. Every soul carries a piece of the puzzle\u2014every battle brings you closer to the self you lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore a vast isometric world scarred by decay. Traverse cursed lands, delve into night-plagued dungeons, and engage in strategic, turn-based combat where unit placement, ability synergy, and resource sacrifice shape the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Recruit spectral allies, customize their traits, and command a shifting roster of the living and the dead. Use spirit tuning to adapt, combine, and evolve your forces. Each soul you collect strengthens your grip on reality\u2014or pulls you deeper into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rebuild the Last Sanctum into a beacon of resistance, unlocking new rituals, upgrades, and memory pathways. Shape your sanctuary with choices that affect the world, the spirits, and your own fragmented fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a tale of vengeance or conquest\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a journey through oblivion, memory, and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To remember is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive is to save what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is The\u00a0Last\u00a0Sanctum.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646380/extras/4d723f7ffa751e3236f849349695ead9.avif?t=1752255894\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Sanctum is a dark fantasy tactical RPG where memory, spirits, and nightmare intertwine in a dying world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You are The Collector\u2014a spirit tuner known only through whispers and fear. Neither alive nor dead, you awaken in the shattered ruins of your sanctum, a vessel of forgotten power, with no memory of who you were or what broke the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 To uncover the truth, you must bind wandering spirits, harvest fragments of lost memories, and confront creatures born of fear and sorrow. Every soul carries a piece of the puzzle\u2014every battle brings you closer to the self you lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore a vast isometric world scarred by decay. Traverse cursed lands, delve into night-plagued dungeons, and engage in strategic, turn-based combat where unit placement, ability synergy, and resource sacrifice shape the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Recruit spectral allies, customize their traits, and command a shifting roster of the living and the dead. Use spirit tuning to adapt, combine, and evolve your forces. Each soul you collect strengthens your grip on reality\u2014or pulls you deeper into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rebuild the Last Sanctum into a beacon of resistance, unlocking new rituals, upgrades, and memory pathways. Shape your sanctuary with choices that affect the world, the spirits, and your own fragmented fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a tale of vengeance or conquest\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a journey through oblivion, memory, and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To remember is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive is to save what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is The\u00a0Last\u00a0Sanctum.</p>",
    "short_description": "A dark fantasy tactical RPG, a forsaken necromancer, raise an army of the damned to reclaim your sanctum. Explore an open, isometric world, conquer cursed dungeons, recruit souls, and master team-based, turn-based combat in a\u00a0decaying\u00a0realm.",
